    "method": "The archived six-repository workspace freezes all dependencies. Identical evaluation benchmark code was added before preserving the baseline executable. Only the scalar evaluator and three curve implementation diffs were then applied. Both benchmark compiler-artifact records report fresh:false. The parameter baseline is the preserved post-Sturm-consolidation executable with the unchanged nine-row driver. Five runs per variant alternate order on logical CPU 7.",
